CHALLENGES WITH THE CURRENT STRUCTURE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The application works, but App has several responsibilities:

• Owns state

• Handles API interaction

• Handles sharing

• Handles keyboard events

• Manages initial loading

• Defines page layout

• Defines action buttons

• Coordinates QuoteCard


This can make App harder to scan as more features are added.


IMPORTANT:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

QuoteCard being presentational is NOT a problem.

In fact, a component that:

INPUT:
Props

OUTPUT:
UI

can be a very useful design.

The main opportunity here is better separation of the surrounding UI.


