IMPORTANT STATE OWNERSHIP REASONING
================================================================================

WHY DOES quote STAY IN App?
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Because:

QuoteDisplay needs quote

AND

handleTweetQuote needs quote


Therefore App is a suitable common owner.


WHY DOES loading STAY IN App?
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Because:

QuoteDisplay needs loading

AND

QuoteActions needs loading


Therefore loading is shared.


WHY DOES color STAY IN App?
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Because:

QuoteContainer needs color

AND

QuoteDisplay needs color


Therefore color is shared.


WHY DOES error STAY IN App?
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Because the quote-fetching process is controlled by App and QuoteDisplay
needs to render the resulting error.


