================================================================================
STEP-BY-STEP: NEW QUOTE
================================================================================

1. User clicks:

   New Quote


2. QuoteActions executes:

   onNewQuote()


3. App's:

   handleGetNewQuote()

   executes


4. App requests:

   setLoading(true)


5. QuoteDisplay receives:

   loading = true


6. QuoteActions receives:

   loading = true


7. UI shows loading state and disables appropriate actions


8. API request finishes


9. App requests state updates:

   setQuote(newQuote)

   setColor(newColor)

   setLoading(false)


10. React processes the updates


11. Children receive current props


12. QuoteDisplay shows the quote


13. QuoteContainer shows the current background


14. QuoteActions becomes usable again


