IMPORTANT PERFORMANCE NOTE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Refactoring into more components does NOT automatically mean:

"Optimized re-renders."

When App state changes, child components can render again.

Component extraction primarily improves:

• Architecture

• Separation

• Maintainability

• Testability


Performance optimization should be based on measurement.

React.memo, useMemo, or useCallback should not be added everywhere simply
because components were extracted.


